<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FORECAST-Australian interest rates poll-Dec.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FORECAST-Australian interest rates poll-Dec.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) board holds its last meeting of 1996 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Ahead of the meeting, Reuters asked 29 economists two questions -- the probability of an interest rate cut in December and in the first quarter of next year.</p>
<p>On the chance for a rate cut in December, the median was 10 percent with a range of zero to 40 percent.</p>
<p>On the chance of a cut in the first quarter of 1997, the median was 50 percent with a range of 10 to 90 percent.</p>
<p>The next RBA board meeting is in early February.</p>
</text>
